 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the last and greatest day of the festival",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus stood up and cried out to the crowd",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He called to every soul that was weary too",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To come to him and drink from the source",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If anyone is thirsty, let him come to me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And drink from the well that never runs dry",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever believes in me, as Scripture said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Out of his heart shall flow rivers of living water",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will look for me and will not find me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where I am you cannot come, they said",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the promise breaks the silence now",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit waits to be given to the faithful",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If anyone is thirsty, let him come to me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And drink from the well that never runs dry",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever believes in me, as Scripture said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Out of his heart shall flow rivers of living water",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some said this really is the Prophet",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Others claimed he is the Christ indeed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the Spirit had not yet been given",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Waiting for the glory yet to come",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If anyone is thirsty, let him come to me",
